],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. In 2026 so far that pair stands at 46% on the middle, with March to April 2026 at 49%. The last full year ended low too, with November to December 2025 at 49% on the middle. Grid 18774 had its driest year in 2007 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
